# the screen reader (fm1-reader, announce.c): a reader listens, and each page, knob, help card, button and
# chord change is said once, in the screen's own text (the words file says it in full)
wait 200
listen
wait 100
# the page, its knobs and the header (the tempo too: it is the Key page's first knob, not Dub's)...
said . Piece Basic, F Dorian, tempo 122, playing
# ...then the main screen, queued: the chord, how far to the next, the section, the scale from the root up
listen
where
said % of the way. Section Full, bar 1. Scale F, G, Ab, Bb, C, D, Eb
# a page settles before it is said
tap ENV
wait 300
said Chord page, voice Saws: Density 30, Throws 
tap GLO
wait 300
said Setup page: Tune 0, MIDI out On, Lights On
# a knob: its name and value, once it settles
spin K1 5
wait 300
said Tune +3
spin K3 1
wait 300
said Lights Keys
spin K3 -1
wait 300
# the Dub page (1.4.0: SELECT turns the filter, said: below)
tap FX
wait 300
said Dub page: Echo 
# SELECT: the filter, said as it turns
turn SELECT -3 100
wait 300
said FILTER
turn SELECT 1 100
wait 300
# the echo times, each in its own words (the words file)
spin K2 -10
wait 300
said Echo time 1/8
spin K2 1
wait 300
said Echo time 1/8.
spin K2 1
wait 300
said Echo time 1/4
spin K2 1
wait 300
said Echo time 1/4.
spin K2 1
wait 300
said Echo time 1/2
spin K2 1
wait 300
said Echo time 1 bar
spin K1 -100
wait 300
said Echo 0
spin K3 -100
wait 300
said Feedback 1.5 s
spin K4 -100
wait 300
said Reverb 0
# the page again, as now set
tap SEQ
wait 300
said Drums page, kit Tight: Kick Four, Hits 
tap FX
wait 300
said Dub page: Echo 0, Echo time 1 bar, Feedback 1.5 s, Reverb 0
tap HOME
wait 300
said Form page: Energy 0, Vary
# (1.4.0, the user's) Energy, the Arrangement page's too: down, sparse and dry; it stops at the middle on the way back
spin K1 -102
wait 300
said Energy -100
spin K1 80
wait 300
said Energy 0
# the chord's Change (the Drift that was the Form page's) in bars, on the Chord page
tap ENV
wait 300
said Chord page, voice Saws: Density
spin K3 -20
wait 300
said Change 2 bars
tap HOME
wait 300
# HOME again: the Song page (1.4.0), its knobs in bars; again: the Key page
tap HOME
wait 300
said Song page, Endless: Intro 32 bars, Main 160 bars, Outro 32 bars, Kind Pulse
tap HOME
wait 300
said Key page: Tempo
spin K1 -100
wait 300
said Tempo 40
# HOME + SELECT: the tempo (the Key page's first knob says it)
press HOME
turn SELECT 2 200
release HOME
wait 300
said Tempo 42
# the keys: a note out of the scale and back in; the root stays
tapkey w1
said REMOVED G
tapkey w1
said ADDED G
tapkey b3
said ADDED C#
tapkey b3
said REMOVED C#
tapkey w0
said THE ROOT STAYS (HOME, KEY)
# the mode (the Key page's KNOB 3, the most common first), ALGORITHM (off a layer's page: the screen), the piece
spin K3 1
said MODE Mixolyd
spin K3 -1
said MODE Dorian
turn ALGO 1
said SCREEN SCOPE
turn ALGO -1
said SCREEN RIPPLES
turn PRESET 1
said PIECE Chamber, A Minor, tempo 
wait 300
said_none Level
turn PRESET -1
said PIECE Basic, F Dorian, tempo 42
wait 300
# the buttons' messages, said once
tap REC
said DUB HOLD ON
# the main screen says it is held
where
said , dub hold. Section 
tap REC
said DUB HOLD OFF
tap PLAY
said RESTING
wait 300
said_none PLAYING
tap PLAY
said PLAYING
wait 300
said_none RESTING
# OCT- / OCT+ on a layer's page: its level (here the pings', on the Pings page)
tap ARP
wait 300
said Pings page, voice Blip: Density 30, Vary 0
tap OCT+
said PINGS 35
tap OCT-
said PINGS 30
press EDIT
wait 600
release EDIT
said NEXT CHORD ON THE BAR
# a nudge (a layer's button held): the layer and its biggest change
press LFO
wait 700
release LFO
said BASS NUDGE
press GLO
wait 600
release GLO
said SAVED
press REC
wait 1000
said EFFECTS GRID. White keys: Throw, Time x2, Tape stop, Swell; Low-pass
release REC
wait 100
# the chord moving by itself (every two bars now): queued (said after what is being said)
wait 8000
said Chord
# a MIDI clock arriving (a second and more of it: said after what is queued), and start / stop from it
midi FA 00 00
midi F8 00 00
