said RESTING
wait 1000
said Tempo 42
tap HOME
wait 300
said Form page
# Change Hold (the Chord page's), and Vary and Motion to known values
tap ENV
wait 300
spin K3 20
wait 300
said Change Hold
tap HOME
wait 300
spin K2 -100
wait 300
said Vary 0
spin K3 100
wait 300
said Motion 100
# WHERE: everything again (the chord held now)
where
said Form page: Energy 0, Vary 0, Motion 100, Drift 41. Piece Basic, F Dorian, tempo 42, resting
where
